# CONSTELLA — AI Development Prompt
**React + TypeScript · Light-First Theme · Phase 1 MVP**

---

## 1. Project Overview

Build **Constella**, a Local-First, Space-Based Personal Knowledge Operating System.

Constella is not a notes app. It is a knowledge OS where every piece of information belongs to a **Space** (React, SpendMap, Dream House, Fitness, etc.). Users never manually organize files or folders. They enter a Space, capture Artifacts, write Blocks, and let the system handle everything else.

The UI philosophy is: **calm workspace, not productivity dashboard**. Content is the hero. Chrome is minimal. Whitespace is generous.

---

## 2. Tech Stack (Exact)

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | React 18 + TypeScript |
| Build Tool | Vite |
| Routing | React Router v6 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v3 |
| Component Library | shadcn/ui |
| State Management | Zustand |
| Local Database | IndexedDB via Dexie.js |
| Block Editor | TipTap v2 |
| Knowledge Graph | React Flow |
| Search | FlexSearch |
| Charts | Recharts |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Animations | Framer Motion (subtle, minimal) |
| Date Handling | date-fns |

> **Note:** This is the web MVP. No Tauri/Electron yet. All persistence goes through Dexie.js (IndexedDB). Cloud sync is **out of scope for Phase 1**.

