## 4. Application Layout (Desktop)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ TopBar                                                          │
│ [Logo]  [─────── Global Search (Ctrl+K) ──────]  [+] [🔔] [👤] │
├──────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────┤
│          │                                      │               │
│ Sidebar  │        Workspace (Main Content)      │   Inspector   │
│ 240px    │        flex-1, overflow-y-auto       │   280px       │
│          │                                      │ (contextual)  │
│          │                                      │               │
├──────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────┤
│ StatusBar — AutoSave · Offline · Artifact Count · AI Status     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Panel rules:**
- Sidebar is collapsible to 56px (icon-only mode)
- Inspector slides in/out — only visible when an Artifact is open
- StatusBar is always 32px tall, low-contrast
- No floating permanent overlays
- Panels are not resizable in Phase 1

**Responsive breakpoints:**
- `≥ 1280px` — three-panel layout
- `768–1279px` — two-panel (Inspector hidden by default, togglable)
- `< 768px` — single panel, bottom navigation

