## 6. Zustand Store Structure

```typescript
// Separate stores, no cross-store direct mutation

useUniverseStore   // global stats, settings
useSpaceStore      // spaces[], activeSpaceId, CRUD
useArtifactStore   // artifacts[], activeArtifactId, CRUD
useSearchStore     // query, results, isSearchOpen
useUIStore         // sidebarCollapsed, inspectorOpen, activeView, theme
useEditorStore     // editorContent, isSaving, lastSaved
```

---

## 7. Screen Flows

### 7.1 App Initialization Flow
```
App mounts
  → Check Dexie DB (create if first run)
  → Load Universe (spaces, settings)
  → If no spaces → redirect to /welcome (onboarding)
  → If spaces exist → redirect to /home
```

### 7.2 Onboarding Flow (first launch)
```
/welcome
  ├── Greeting screen: "Welcome to Constella"
  │    Subtext: "Your personal knowledge universe"
  │    CTA: "Create your first Space →"
  │
  └── Space creation modal:
       - Name input (required)
       - Template selector (6 tiles: Learning, Project, Research, Dream, Personal, Blank)
       - Icon picker (emoji or category icons)
       - Color picker (8 preset Space accent colors)
       - CTA: "Create Space"
       → Redirect to /spaces/:id
```

### 7.3 Home Screen Flow (`/home`)
```
/home
  ├── Section: "Continue Working" — last 3 opened Artifacts (mini cards)
  ├── Section: "Pinned Spaces" — SpaceCard grid (max 6, 3 per row)
  ├── Section: "Recent Spaces" — SpaceCard list (last 8)
  ├── Section: "Recent Activity" — Timeline feed (last 20 events)
  └── Section: "Quick Stats" — Total spaces, total artifacts, streak

Clicking a SpaceCard → /spaces/:id
Clicking an Artifact mini card → /spaces/:spaceId/artifacts/:id
```

### 7.4 Space Screen Flow (`/spaces/:id`)
```
/spaces/:id
  ├── SpaceHeader (always visible)
  │    - Icon, Name, Description, Progress bar, Artifact count
  │    - Favorite button, Settings button
  │
  ├── Tab Navigation: [Dashboard] [Artifacts] [Timeline] [Graph] [Goals]
  │
  ├── Dashboard (default tab)
  │    Widget grid: Progress · Continue Working · Pinned Artifacts
  │                 Recent Activity · Goals · AI Suggestions
  │
  ├── Artifacts tab → ArtifactExplorer
  │    View toggle: [Grid] [List] [Timeline] [Kanban]
  │    Filters: Type · Status · Tags · Priority · Date
  │    Sort: Updated · Created · Alpha · Favorites
  │
  ├── Timeline tab → chronological activity log
  ├── Graph tab → React Flow knowledge graph (nodes = artifacts)
  └── Goals tab → goal list/board

Clicking any ArtifactCard → opens ArtifactEditor in Workspace
Inspector panel slides in with metadata
```

### 7.5 Artifact Editor Flow
```
Click ArtifactCard
  → ArtifactEditor opens in Workspace (replaces ArtifactExplorer)
  → Inspector slides in on the right

ArtifactEditor layout (top to bottom):
  - Artifact type badge + back button
  - Title (large, editable h1)
  - Description (subtitle, editable)
  - Tag chips + "Add tag" button
  - Divider
  - TipTap BlockEditor (full width, unlimited height)
  - Divider
  - Section: Relationships (linked artifacts)
  - Section: Attachments
  - Section: Version History (future)

Auto-save triggers on:
  - 500ms debounce after typing stops
  - Tab switch
  - Space navigation
  - App blur

No Save button. Show "Saved" in StatusBar.
```

### 7.6 Global Search Flow (`Ctrl + K`)
```
Ctrl+K → Search modal opens (full-width overlay, centered, max-w-2xl)
  Input focused immediately
  Typing → FlexSearch queries local index → results appear instantly

Results grouped:
  [Spaces]    — space icon + name
  [Artifacts] — type icon + title + space name
  [Tags]      — tag chip

Arrow keys to navigate, Enter to open, Esc to close
No results state: "Nothing found. Try different keywords."
```

### 7.7 Quick Capture Flow
```
Ctrl+N or "+" button in TopBar
  → QuickCapture modal (compact, max-w-lg)

  Form fields:
    - Type selector: [Knowledge] [Snippet] [Bug] [Idea] [Bookmark] [Task] [Goal]
    - Title input (required, auto-focus)
    - Body textarea (optional, expandable)
    - Space selector:
        If a Space is already active → pre-selected, changeable
        If on Home → required, dropdown with space list

  CTA: "Capture" (primary button)
  Side CTA: "Capture & Open" (opens full editor after saving)

Must complete in < 5 seconds for a simple capture.
```

