## 8. Component Breakdown

### Layout Components
```
AppLayout           — top-level layout shell
TopBar              — logo, search, quick capture, notifications, profile
Sidebar             — space navigation, collapsible
  SidebarSection    — labeled group (Pinned, Recent, Views, etc.)
  SidebarItem       — nav item with icon, label, active state
Workspace           — main content area (flex-1)
Inspector           — right panel, slides in/out
StatusBar           — bottom bar (fixed 32px)
ResizablePanel      — (future, Phase 2)
```

### Shared UI Components (all from shadcn/ui + custom)
```
Button              — primary, secondary, ghost, destructive
Input, Textarea, Select
Badge               — for tags, artifact types, statuses
Avatar              — user avatar circle
Tooltip             — on hover for icon-only actions
Toast               — success/error/info notifications (top-right)
Dialog / Sheet      — for modals and side drawers
ContextMenu         — right-click on SpaceCard, ArtifactCard
DropdownMenu        — profile menu, filter dropdowns
ProgressBar         — Space progress indicator
Skeleton            — loading placeholders
EmptyState          — icon + heading + CTA for empty views
```

### Feature Components
```
SpaceCard           — card with icon, name, progress, artifact count, hover actions
SpaceHeader         — top section of a Space (icon, name, desc, progress, meta)
SpaceCreationModal  — onboarding + new space dialog

ArtifactCard        — grid/list item with type icon, title, tags, date
ArtifactEditor      — full editing view (title + TipTap + meta)
ArtifactExplorer    — grid/list/timeline/kanban view with filters

BlockEditor         — TipTap instance with custom block extensions
  HeadingBlock, ParagraphBlock, CodeBlock, ImageBlock
  ChecklistBlock, QuoteBlock, CalloutBlock, DividerBlock
  TableBlock, MermaidBlock, MathBlock

QuickCapture        — global capture modal
GlobalSearch        — Ctrl+K search overlay
KnowledgeGraph      — React Flow canvas (Space Graph tab)
TimelineFeed        — chronological activity log
GoalsView           — goal list / board view
DashboardGrid       — widget grid for Space dashboard
  Widget: Progress, RecentArtifacts, PinnedArtifacts, Goals, Timeline, AIHint
InspectorPanel      — metadata sidebar (tags, relationships, history)
```

