## 11. Artifact Type Reference

| Type | Icon (Lucide) | Badge Color | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| knowledge | `BookOpen` | Indigo | Concepts, notes, explanations |
| snippet | `Code2` | Green | Reusable code pieces |
| bug | `Bug` | Rose | Issues, problems, errors |
| idea | `Lightbulb` | Amber | Raw ideas, concepts |
| resource | `Link` | Sky | URLs, references, docs |
| media | `Image` | Slate | Images, videos, files |
| task | `CheckSquare` | Slate | To-do items |
| goal | `Target` | Violet | Objectives, milestones |
| bookmark | `Bookmark` | Orange | Saved content |
| document | `FileText` | Neutral | Formal documents |
| voice_note | `Mic` | Pink | Audio notes |

Each ArtifactCard shows the type icon + a pill badge with the type name in its corresponding badge color.

---

## 12. Space Templates

When a Space is created, the template sets the Dashboard widget layout and suggests artifact types:

| Template | Default Widgets | Suggested Types |
|---|---|---|
| Learning | Progress, Continue Working, Goals, Timeline | Knowledge, Snippet, Resource, Bookmark |
| Project | Goals, Pinned Artifacts, Recent Bugs, Timeline | Task, Bug, Document, Snippet |
| Research | Pinned Artifacts, Knowledge Graph, Timeline | Knowledge, Resource, Idea, Bookmark |
| Dream | Goals, Media, Timeline, AI Suggestions | Idea, Media, Goal, Document |
| Personal | Continue Working, Timeline, Goals | Task, Goal, Document, Voice Note |
| Blank | Recent Artifacts, Timeline | All types equally |

