## 16. Routing Structure

```
/                     → redirect to /home (if onboarded) or /welcome
/welcome              → Onboarding (first launch)
/home                 → Home screen
/spaces               → All Spaces list
/spaces/new           → Create Space (modal route or page)
/spaces/:id           → Space screen (Dashboard tab by default)
/spaces/:id/artifacts → Artifact Explorer tab
/spaces/:id/timeline  → Timeline tab
/spaces/:id/graph     → Knowledge Graph tab
/spaces/:id/goals     → Goals tab
/spaces/:id/artifacts/:artifactId  → Artifact Editor
/settings             → Settings (General, Appearance, Editor, Storage, Shortcuts)
/archive              → Archived Spaces and Artifacts
/trash                → Deleted items
```

