## 18. Implementation Order (Phase 1)

Build in this order to get a working foundation fast:

1. **DB Setup** — Dexie schema, repositories for Space + Artifact + Block
2. **Layout Shell** — AppLayout, TopBar (static), Sidebar (static), StatusBar
3. **Routing** — React Router setup, all routes defined
4. **Welcome/Onboarding** — SpaceCreationModal, template selection
5. **Home Screen** — SpaceCard, recent spaces grid, pinned spaces
6. **Space Screen** — SpaceHeader, tab navigation (shell only)
7. **ArtifactExplorer** — Grid view + ArtifactCard + filters
8. **ArtifactEditor** — TipTap integration, auto-save, Inspector panel
9. **Quick Capture** — Global modal, Ctrl+N shortcut
10. **Global Search** — Ctrl+K modal, FlexSearch indexing
11. **Timeline** — auto-generated from DB events
12. **Knowledge Graph** — React Flow basic nodes + edges
13. **Dashboard Widgets** — Progress, Recent, Pinned, Goals shell
14. **Sidebar** — full navigation with collapse, context menus
15. **Settings** — Appearance (theme toggle), Editor prefs, Shortcuts list

---

## 19. Core Constraints

- **No cloud sync in Phase 1.** All data stays in IndexedDB. Show a "Local only" badge in StatusBar.
- **No authentication in Phase 1.** Single-user, no login.
- **No AI in Phase 1.** The AI Suggestions widget renders static placeholder cards.
- **No file attachments in Phase 1.** Images can be pasted into TipTap via base64 only.
- **Auto-save is non-negotiable.** There must be zero Save buttons.
- **Search must be offline-first.** FlexSearch index must be populated on every artifact write.
- **Every empty list must show an EmptyState.** Never show a bare blank div.
- **Light theme is default.** Dark theme is toggled manually via Settings or system preference.
- **No feature flags, no A/B testing, no analytics.** Keep it clean.

---

## 20. Design Don'ts

- No glassmorphism
- No heavy gradients (subtle linear gradients only for Space cover colors)
- No excessive drop shadows (shadow-sm maximum)
- No animations over 300ms
- No full-page loading spinners (skeleton loaders only)
- No floating panels that don't belong to the five permanent regions
- No modals that cannot be closed with Escape
- No placeholder buttons that do nothing without a TODO comment

---

